{"id":"wb-7-1901","name":"熊庆来故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"熊庆来故居","text":"熊庆来故居，位于中国云南省红河州弥勒市朋普镇庆来村（原息宰村），是一座建于清光绪年间的典型滇南四合院民居建筑，为中国近代数学家熊庆来的故居。\n熊庆来故居与腾冲艾思奇故居、玉溪聂耳故居和文山楚图南故居并称云南近代名人四大故居。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%86%8A%E5%BA%86%E6%9D%A5%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":90843411,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90843411","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名称、所在地与对应遗址；原名录行政地址及参考点位不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4c75d48caa06daf5912b21d0.jpg","title":"弥勒熊庆来故居大门.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BC%A5%E5%8B%92%E7%86%8A%E5%BA%86%E6%9D%A5%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E5%A4%A7%E9%97%A8.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3d/%E5%BC%A5%E5%8B%92%E7%86%8A%E5%BA%86%E6%9D%A5%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E5%A4%A7%E9%97%A8.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangmoon618","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​位于弥勒市朋普镇庆来村的熊庆来故居大门，属于全国重点文物保护单位。","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图"}}